            "fullText": "So, De Jong is fit, and will start for theNetherlands.Memphis Depay ​starts on ‌the bench, Quinten Timber out ‌with concussion. Gyokeres and Isak lead Sweden attack. Yasin Ayari starts in midfield after scoring two goals against Tunisia.",
